<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-states"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20States.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United States</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Union victory and the Thirteenth Amendment end slavery</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/argentine-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Argentine%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Argentine Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Argentina joins Brazil and Uruguay in the war against Paraguay</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/tu-i-tonga-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Tu%CA%BBi%20Tonga%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Tuʻi Tonga Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Laufilitonga, the last Tuʻi Tonga, dies and the title lapses</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/abolitionism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Abolitionism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Abolitionism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Thirteenth Amendment abolishes slavery throughout the United States</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/self-strengthening-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Self-Strengthening%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Self-Strengthening Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Zeng Guofan and Li Hongzhang found the Jiangnan Arsenal at Shanghai</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/confederate-states-of-america"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Confederate%20States%20of%20America.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Confederate States of America</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 9 April Richmond having fallen when Lee's lines broke at Petersburg, Lee surrenders at Appomattox Court House; Davis is captured on 10 May and the last land forces surrender by June.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/environmental-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Environmental%20movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Environmental movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Commons Preservation Society is founded in Britain to defend the countryside against industrialisation</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/abraham-lincoln"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Abraham%20Lincoln.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Abraham Lincoln</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">John Wilkes Booth shoots him at Ford's Theatre on April 14, and he dies the next morning</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/florence"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Florence.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Florence</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Florence replaces Turin as capital of the Kingdom of Italy</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/menelik-ii"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Menelik%20II.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Menelik II</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Menelik escapes from Maqdala, and in 1866 proclaims himself Negus of Shewa</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/underground-railroad"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Underground%20Railroad.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Underground Railroad</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Thirteenth Amendment outlaws slavery except as punishment for a crime</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/hundred-days-reform"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hundred%20Days'%20Reform.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hundred Days' Reform</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Jiangnan Arsenal is established in Shanghai and becomes the largest factory in China</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/social-darwinism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Social%20Darwinism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Social Darwinism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Francis Galton puts forward the ideas later known as eugenics, and returns to them in 1869</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/spiritism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Spiritism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Spiritism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Spiritism reaches Brazil in the 1860s; the Brazilian Spiritist Federation dates its arrival to this year</span></li></ul></section>
